EXT. RAILROAD CROSSING - STALLED SCHOOL BUS - DAY

Yellow bus dead on the tracks. Hood up. Steam. Bells clang. Red lights flash.

REMY DELACROIX-ADEYEMI (16, letterman jacket) hauls on the emergency door. Jammed.

ZURI ABARA (16, braids, backpack) kicks the front bumper. Nothing.

REMY
It's stuck!

ZURI
Of course it's stuck!

Bells. Lights. Far off, a train horn.

REMY
Get the window!

ZURI
Get the door!

They yell it at the same time, glare at each other, then both grab the handle. Heave. Metal screams. The door pops free.

Remy tumbles out. Zuri follows.

The horn blares, close. They sprint off the tracks.

The train thunders past. Wind. Dust. Sparks.

They crouch in the gravel, panting, ears ringing.

ZURI
You're an idiot.

REMY
You're welcome.
